OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, among eight more people
OL,4,Aarrested over Glasgow Green disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy is among a further
OL,7,Feight people to have been charged in
OL,8,Fconnection with a range of offences
OL,9,Flinked to disorder on Glasgow Green in
OL,10,FJuly involving anti-immigration and
OL,11,Fanti-racism campaigners.
OL,13,FSix men, aged 22, 30, 30, 32, 42, and
OL,14,F53, and a 35-year-old woman have been
OL,15,Fcharged with offences including
OL,16,Fassault, possession of an offensive
OL,17,Fweapon, hate crime and breach of the
OL,18,Fpeace.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
